  "data": [
    {
      "abstract": "Isolated-photon differential cross section measured in pp and Pb$-$Pb collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{\\mathrm{NN}}}=5.02~\\mathrm{TeV}$ for five Pb$-$Pb centrality classes for $R=0.2$. Note that the Pb$-$Pb data in the first five columns is scaled by $\\langle N_{\\mathrm{coll}} \\rangle$, unlike in the figure in the paper where the theory was scaled by $\\langle N_{\\mathrm{coll}} \\rangle$. Last two columns correspond to theory NLO pQCD calculations with JETPHOX, for pp (PDF) and Pb$-$Pb (nPDF) collisions calculated for the 0$-$100% centrality class. Data statistical and systematic uncertainties are provided. The theory scale and PDF uncertainties are provided. The data normalisation uncertainties are provided in the paper.",
